                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-e-3">You can submit your work as a website,
                            PDF, Notion page, Figma link, or Google Drive folder. The format matters less than how
                            clearly your ideas, process, and outcomes are communicated.</p>
                    </div>

