                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-e-4">That’s okay. You can submit a problem
                            exploration, redesign concept, research exercise, or product idea instead. We’re assessing
                            your potential to grow into a product designer, not just past credentials.</p>
                    </div>

