                            to students admitted to the PGP. We offer a variety of options, each close to our campus and
                            equipped with amenities to ensure a comfortable living experience. The fees for the course,
                            as mentioned on the website, do not include hostel fees. The full fee structure, including
                            that of the hostel, is sent to all our admitted students along with their offer letter.</p>
                    </div>

