                <div id="tab77" class="content">

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-g-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Is participation in immersions mandatory or optional?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-g-1">Participation in any immersion is optional and depends on the
                            student’s interest. Since our immersions are theme-based, students can choose the one that
                            best aligns with their career goals and learning preferences.

                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-g-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Is the immersion fee included in the tuition fee?

                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-g-2">The immersion fee is not included in the tuition fee. It is a
                            separate, optional cost applicable only to students who choose to participate in the Global
                            or Bharat Immersion programmes. 1 day off campus immersions are part of your programme with
                            no added fee.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-g-3">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> Are there scholarships or financial aid options available?
