                            industry-integrated, tech-driven curriculum designed for business management professionals.
                            The IIM Bangalore (BBA) degree is a traditional academic qualification offered with standard
                            coursework and university examinations.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-j-3">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> What makes the Masters’ Union Programme a better choice than earning
